      ],
      "text": "Twing is a CLI plus a hook for coding agents (Claude Code today, others planned) and a small server that every agent's client talks to, letting multiple agents on a team coordinate."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ec541e5cef76b42759dcbbad9d5650b786eba1d1761952b3dd290a0c46197fc7",
