          "git_sha": "ddf1a792c520d9ff5202a9fd40b67bba2e936ffa",
          "line_end": 57,
          "line_start": 38,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "twing-dev/twing-cli",
          "url": "https://github.com/Twing-dev/twing-cli/blob/49b1d2c199119d05ab217c8e659a21ea78be4ae5/README.md#L38-L57"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b67ee458bb22f9d33313e86fd9582fbb76a50f3427cc8d96abd860e1daa537a7"
      ],
      "text": "Setup installs a hook wired into Claude Code and starts a background daemon; hooks are stateless per-invocation, while the daemon watches edits and syncs them to the server."
    },
